@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
actor Pengguna
boundary "Halaman Virtual Assistant" as UI
control "POST /api/virtual-assistant/chat" as Proxy
collections "Kuota Akun" as Quota
control "Gapura RAG FastAPI" as RAG
database "Pinecone" as Vector
control "Retriever/Reranker" as Retrieve
control "OpenRouter LLM" as LLM

Pengguna -> UI : ajukan pertanyaan
UI -> Proxy : pertanyaan + riwayat + sesi
Proxy -> Proxy : verifikasi sesi dan normalisasi masukan
Proxy -> Quota : konsumsi kuota harian
alt sesi tidak valid atau kuota habis
  Quota --> Proxy : ditolak / retry-after
  Proxy --> UI : 401 atau 429
  UI --> Pengguna : pesan terkendali
else diizinkan
  Quota --> Proxy : remaining + reset_at
  Proxy -> RAG : POST /api/chat + proxy secret
  RAG -> Retrieve : embedding pertanyaan dan retrieval
  Retrieve -> Vector : similarity search + filter sumber
  Vector --> Retrieve : kandidat chunk
  Retrieve -> Retrieve : reranking dan pemilihan evidence
  Retrieve -> LLM : pertanyaan + konteks terpilih
  LLM --> RAG : jawaban ter-grounding
  RAG --> Proxy : stream jawaban + sumber/halaman
  Proxy --> UI : text/event-stream + header kuota
  UI --> Pengguna : tampilkan jawaban dan evidence
end
@enduml
